{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b71e2b3c-e181-8599-ae6e-8140dee466da",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T09:26:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:24:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. My name is Peggy Cullen. I'm calling about trash and recycling pickup. I wanted to find out the new schedule after the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Which address are you at, Ms. Cullen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "248 Kingston Avenue. That's up on the Hill. And I should say, I filled out a form on the city website earlier this morning, around eight-fifteen, and my browser autofill typed in the wrong address. It put in an old one. So if you see something come through with a different address, that's not me. I mean, it's me, but it's wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:25:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you for telling me. So the form went in with an old address, and your real one is 248 Kingston Avenue. Did you want to resubmit it, or was it just something general?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:25:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was just a general question about pickup. I'll resubmit it, but I figured calling was faster. Actually, I'll correct that, I'm not sure I even hit submit. Either way, I'm asking you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Let me pull up your area. Hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:25:44-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. So, with the holiday this week, pickups are pushed back a day for the rest of the week. Your normal day is Thursday, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:25:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Thursday. Trash every week, and recycling every other week. Last recycling was the eighteenth, I think. Or the seventeenth. No, the eighteenth, because that was a Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So your Thursday pickup this week would move to Friday, January second. Then you're back to your regular Thursday schedule the week after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the next pickup is this Friday, the second, not tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct, this Friday the second. Put it out the night before or early that morning, before the usual time. And I have recycling falling on that pickup, since it's every other week from the eighteenth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so Friday the second, trash and recycling both. And then Thursday the eighth, trash only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Friday the second, both, then Thursday the eighth, just trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. That's all I needed. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Happy New Year, Ms. Cullen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T09:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
